=== introduction ===
    Hi! I saw this number in an ad online, I was wondering if you could help get my coworker off my back for once?
    I'm not sure what you can do exactly... I mean I don't want her dead or anything, and definitely no kind of injury she would probably just try and milk it for attention...
    No, no. Maybe you could just change her mind, can you do that? Just make her forget me or just so she no longer hates me.
    
    + [I'll need a few more details]
    -> questions
    
    + [That's all I need *hang up*]
    -> hangUp
        
=== questions ===
    (Gather some more info or CLICK the phone again to hang up)
    
    + [What's your name, age, and occupation?]
    Bethany, 22. I'm an entry level accountant at a pretty major firm for where i'm from, in fact my father used to own the company until not long after I got the job.
    -> questions
        
    + [What inspired you to make this wish?]
    I feel like ever since I got this job that damn grouch Melinda has been always out to get me, it's like she has some deep-rooted personal grudge against me but whenever I've confronted her she simply just says that I "dont belong here". 
    -> questions
        
    + [Any other details you can give me?]
    Not that I can think of, I just want this all to be over with so everyone will stop acting so strange around me. I know she's been working here for a very long time but it's still crazy that they all tiptoe around me whenever she's nearby.
    -> questions
        
=== hangUp ===
    /DISCONNECTED/
    -> DONE